{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Consolidated the scattered eval / replayable-plan-review work into one epic, compliant-lemon-grunion (759e-7dc1-675c-4877): a three-tier replay harness (Tier 0 Pass-3 zero-LLM over the whole sidecar corpus; Tier 1 Pass-2 on stored Pass-1 findings, Sonnet via Bedrock; Tier 2 Pass-1 on a fixed 20-plan sample, Opus via Bedrock, with single-criterion mode) under a hard $200 Bedrock ledger, a model-parity guard (production model per pass, homogeneous Bedrock chain, no cheaper-model substitution), free outcome labels + reviewer-noise floor, and a change-protocol ADR. Nine new children: celestine-treasonous-ewe (corpus), expectable-clownlike-ynambu (labels), bouncy-peacockish-titmouse (tier 0), presolar-finable-binturong (tier 1), peaceable-choppy-sapsucker (tier 2), fizzy-hypnotic-boto (ledger), magnesian-subjective-ocelot (parity), undamaged-adept-xenarthra (usage-log ticket-id bug), furred-uneasy-platypus (ADR/docs). Folded in as children: ridiculous-expert-mouse, auspicious-torrid-curlew, brutal-idiocratic-rodent (epic→story). jira-reb-529 closed as superseded (link-backed disposition, no LLM). jira-reb-1589 and fort-wisp-wren now depend_on the epic; spin-cub-usher, yip-gem-teak, pastoral-aquatic-viper linked relates_to. Filed production bug paternal-repayable-flamingo (prompt caching silently disabled since 2026-08-12 by the mixed Bedrock+Anthropic class fallback; ~2x review cost). Investigation evidence (corpus counts, replay seams, per-pass cost) is recorded as a comment on the epic. No code changed; no LLM gate ops run."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788029564109242745,"uuid":"98f044f6-0e77-4508-87fa-893e05645ef1"}